@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Estructura de un "Repopackage Module" (Independiente y Testeable)

package "Module: [Nombre]" #FEFEFE {
    [contract.yaml] as Meta <<Metadata & I/O>>
    [README.md] as Doc <<Usage & Context>>
    
    folder "src" {
        [logic.py] as Logic
        [interface.py] as API <<Entry Points>>
    }
    
    folder "tests" {
        [test_unit.py] as Unit
        [test_contract.py] as Contract <<I/O Validation>>
    }
}

note right of Meta
  Define:
  - Input Schema
  - Output Schema
  - Dependencies (otros módulos)
  - External Libs (Prioridad: Repackage)
end note

note bottom of Contract
  Valida que el módulo cumple 
  su contrato de entrada/salida 
  independientemente de la lógica interna.
end note

@enduml
